# Review ownership.
#
# The ruleset keeps `required_approving_review_count` at 0, so this file does not
# block a merge: GitHub only auto-requests the owners below as reviewers. It still
# records who owns the gates themselves.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner>...   (last matching pattern wins)

# CI definitions, PR gates and the branch rules themselves must not be changed
# by the person the gate is meant to stop.
